  "name": "Environment, Food and Rural Affairs Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Environment, Food and Rural Affairs Committee (EFRA) scrutinises the work of the Department for Environment, Food and Rural Affairs (Defra). It looks at issues from farming to the water sector to a circular economy. View the full list of <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/publications/46956/documents/242314/default/\">the committee’s strategic priorities</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media:&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees\">LinkedIn</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/\">Reddit</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://x.com/HoCcommitteesUK\">X</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a></u></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">Sign up to the&nbsp;weekly cross-committee newsletter, ‘Committee Corridor’.</a></p>",
